Security Operations / Web Security Remediation Project

This project demonstrates hands-on experience in external attack surface reduction, web security hardening, 
threat intelligence utilization, and security validation. 
External risk assessments conducted using UpGuard were reviewed, 
and all remediation and validation activities were personally executed to reduce the organization’s external attack surface. 
Remediation was performed from August 5 to September 5, 2025, resulting in a confirmed improvement in the external cyber risk rating from C to A.
